<title>Australia: RTRS-Ridley half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ridley half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     10.94 vs 11.95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     16.60 vs 19.11</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			3.75 vs 3.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Ridley Corp Ltd is a stockfeed manufacturer.</p>
